    Taylor’s formula modulo their squared differences gives, for any holomorphic $F$,
  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(7.18)")
   $ delta_k \( F \( t \) \) = sum_i F_(t_i) \( t \) delta_k \( t_i \) . $ <signed:chain-rule>]
