    The insertion and $D_S gt.eq H$ give the precise pole bounds
  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(7.20)")
   $ eta_alpha & in omega_(hat(Z)) \( H + A + k D_S \) \,\
eta_beta - eta_alpha \, quad eta_alpha Delta_i & in omega_(hat(Z)) \( H + A \) \,\
eta_alpha Delta_i Delta_l \, quad \( eta_beta - eta_alpha \) Delta_i & in omega_(hat(Z)) \( H + A - k D_S \)
